        <mxCell id="L_cost" value="&lt;b&gt;Biaya yang dibayar tiap hari:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Per server customer: 5 API + 5 UI + 6 database container + Core&lt;br&gt;• Resep → farmasi → kasir = lompat jaringan, tidak bisa 1 transaksi&lt;br&gt;• Laporan lintas modul = API composition / CQRS, bukan SQL JOIN&lt;br&gt;• 1 fitur = 2 repo, 2 CI, matriks kompatibilitas versi Core × app&lt;br&gt;• IT client on-prem harus paham Docker multi-service" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=4;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="L">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="480" width="780" height="140" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

